      "id": "mlreg-003",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "入门",
      "subtopic": "MLflow 模型注册",
      "knowledgePoint": "别名含义",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "MLflow 的模型别名与固定版本号有什么主要区别？",
      "answer": "别名是指向某个版本的可变命名引用，版本号用于标识具体版本。",
      "explanation": "别名可以重新指向同一注册模型的其他版本。",
      "example": "将 champion 从版本 1 改为版本 2。",
      "tags": [
        "MLflow 模型注册",
        "别名含义"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://github.com/mlflow/mlflow/blob/v2.22.0/docs/docs/model-registry/index.mdx"
    },
    {
      "id": "mlreg-004",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "入门",
      "subtopic": "MLflow 模型注册",
      "knowledgePoint": "别名URI",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "MLflow 如何用别名 URI 指向注册模型 MyModel 的 champion 版本？",
      "answer": "使用 models:/MyModel@champion。",
      "explanation": "解析结果取决于该别名当时指向的版本。",
      "example": "生产代码通过别名查找当前候选模型。",
      "tags": [
        "MLflow 模型注册",
        "别名URI"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
